 "category_zh": "历史遗址",
 "category_en": "Historic site",
 "intro_zh": "大明宫始建于唐太宗贞观八年，占地3.5平方公里，其面积相当于4.5个故宫，充分显示了唐代宫城建筑的雄伟风貌。大明宫遗址是1961年国务院公布的首批全国重点文物保护单位之一，是丝绸之路整体申请世界文化遗产的重要组成部分。",
 "intro_en": "The Daming Palace was the imperial palace complex of the Tang dynasty, located in its capital Chang'an. It served as the imperial residence of the Tang emperors for more than 220 years. Today, it is designated as a national heritage site of China, and part of the UNESCO World Heritage Site \"Silk Roads: the Routes Network of Chang'an-Tianshan Corridor\". The area is located northeast of present-day Xi'an, Shaanxi Province.",
 "intro_en_source": "wikipedia",
